; The installer's own texts (patorrent.nsi includes this as UTF-8), in every language it loads:
; makensis warns about a language left out. The association texts and the menu names (File >
; Exit) are the app's own translations (crates/frontend/lang/*.lng); "Retry" is the button
; Windows shows in each language. Kept few on purpose: everything else is NSIS's.

